  "notes": [
    "GENERAL NOTES: (a) These casting quality factors, together with the referenced Notes, are requirements of this Code. (b) Notes marked with an asterisk (*) restate requirements found in the text of the Code. NOTES: (1) Specifications are ASTM. (2) *These quality factors are determined in accordance with para. 302.3.3(b). See para. 302.3.3(c) and Table 302.3.3-1 for increased quality factors applicable in special cases. See also para. 302.3.1(a), footnote 1. (3) *For pressure–temperature ratings of components made in accordance with standards listed in Table 326.1.1-1, see para. 326.2.1. Stress values in Table A-1 (Table A-1C) may be used to calculate ratings for unlisted components, and special ratings for listed components, as permitted by para. 303.",
    "NOTES: (Cont'd) (4) *This casting quality factor can be enhanced by supplementary examination in accordance with para. 302.3.3(c) and Table 302.3.3-1. The higher factor from Table 302.3.3-1 may be substituted for this factor in pressure design equations. (5) *This casting quality factor is applicable only when proper supplementary examination has been performed (see para. 302.3.3)."
